DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3350 kcal\, 175 g protein\, 455 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 35-45 g protein in 4 meals\, 40-70 g carbs before 
 lifting\, and a protein-plus-carb meal after training.\nCategory: gym\nRu
 n volume: 0 km\n\n\nAdjustments:\n- Reduced for prior-month recovery feed
 back.\n\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-8 min easy cardio\, joint preparation\, and ramp
  sets for the first movement.\n\n\nMain Work:\n- Bench press: 3 working s
 ets at RPE 8.\n- Incline dumbbell press: 2 working sets at RPE 8.\n- Dumb
 bell shoulder press: 3 working sets at RPE 8.\n- Lateral raises: 3 workin
 g sets at RPE 8.\n- Tricep pulldown: 3 working sets at RPE 8.\n- Rotator 
 cuff external rotation: 3 working sets at RPE 7.\n\n\nFueling:\n- Hit dai
 ly macros\, keep protein near target\, and place carbohydrates before and
  after training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; add m
 obility if joints feel stiff.\n\n\nProgression & Guardrails:\n- Progressi
 on: double progression\; add load only after clean top-range reps at RPE 
 8 or lower\, about 2 RIR.
