 oblet squat: 3 working sets at RPE 8.\n- Romanian deadlift: 3 working set
 s at RPE 8.\n- Seated or lying hamstring curl: 3 working sets at RPE 8.\n
 - Seated calf raise: 3 working sets at RPE 7.\n- Tibialis raises: 4 worki
 ng sets at RPE 7.\n- Side plank: 2 working sets at RPE 7.\n- Activation: 
 light good mornings: 2 x 12-15 at RPE 5-6 using no more than 50% of norma
 l working load\; stop if symptoms rise or the next morning is worse.\n\n\
 nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and place carb
 ohydrates before and after training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays
